{"about_the_game":"&quot;Egg Defense&quot; is a game where players defend against eggs emerging from portals by deploying their units.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><br>Enemy monsters consist of eggs. Eggs emerge from portals and evolve as they move along the path, breaking shells at specific distances.<br>Players can deploy their units to block the eggs. Each unit has unique skills. Units gain mana by attacking, and when mana is charged, they can activate special skills.<br>The game offers opportunities to upgrade character skills every 5 stages. Players can choose one of three cards to upgrade character skills in that stage.<br>With these features, &quot;Egg Defense&quot; offers a casual strategy game with delightful action. Unique character designs and various battle strategies provide players with an enjoyable gaming experience.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Skill upgrade</h2><br>Before upgrade<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/skill3-before-new-30.gif?t=1719481457\" /><br>After upgrade<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/extras/Skill3-after-new-30.gif?t=1719481457\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2864800?t=1719481457","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2864800?t=1719481457","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1719481457","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2864800/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1719481457","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"&quot;Egg Defense&quot; is a game where players defend against eggs emerging from portals by deploying their units.<h2 class=\"bb_ta